  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Figure shows a network of capacitors where the number indicates capacitances in micro Farad. The value of capacitance C if the equivalent capacitance between point A and B is to be <math><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>F</mi></math> is :<br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0138_5db3702c0ec2.png\" style=\"width: 364px; height: 200px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>μ</mi><mi>F</mi></math>",
